# Asparagus

Based on [Simply Recipes](https://www.simplyrecipes.com/recipes/how_to_cook_asparagus_on_the_stovetop) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250515062336/https://www.simplyrecipes.com/recipes/how_to_cook_asparagus_on_the_stovetop))

{ rating="4" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1/2 - 1 lb. [Asparagus]{ ing="asparagus" }
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] (Optional) [garlic clove]{ ing="garlic-clove" }, lemon peel, etc.

## Recipe

1. Boil 3/4-1” water in a large, covered skillet. Add [salt]{ ing="salt" } and optional [clove]{ ing="garlic-clove" }, lemon peel, etc.
1. Chop the inedible bottom of the [Asparagus]{ ing="asparagus" } off
1. Cover and cook the [asparagus]{ ing="asparagus" } for 5-7 minutes
1. Add additional [salt]{ ing="salt" }, pepper, lemon juice, oil, butter, etc. before serving
